
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="FEARLESS Gaming — gaming, creativity, Minecraft, Free Fire and web development.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#070b16">
<title>FEARLESS Gaming | Play Without Limits</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: #070b16;
  color: #fff;
}
header {
  padding: 20px 15px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #10162a;
  border-bottom: 1px solid #00eaff;
}
.logo {
  font-size: 30px;
  font-weight: 900;
  color: #00eaff;
  text-shadow: 0 0 15px #00eaff;
}
header p {
  color: #aab7d4;
  margin-top: 8px;
  font-size: 12px;
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}
nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 22px;
  padding: 17px 10px;
  background: #0b1120;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 10;
}
nav a {
  color: #fff;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-size: 14px;
}
nav a:hover { color: #00eaff; }

.hero {
  min-height: 440px;
  padding: 70px 20px;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 40%, #193a62, #070b16 70%);
}
.tag {
  border: 1px solid #00eaff;
  color: #00eaff;
  padding: 8px 14px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 12px;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}
.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(38px, 10vw, 70px);
  line-height: 1.1;
  font-weight: 900;
}
.hero h1 span { color: #00eaff; }
.hero p {
  color: #bac7e0;
  line-height: 1.8;
  max-width: 500px;
  margin: 20px 0 28px;
}
.btn {
  display: inline-block;
  padding: 14px 22px;
  border-radius: 8px;
  background: #00d9ff;
  color: #07101c;
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  transition: .2s;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  border: 1px solid #00eaff;
  color: #00eaff;
  margin-left: 8px;
}
section { padding: 55px 18px; }
.section-title {
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 27px;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}
.section-sub {
  text-align: center;
  color: #9eacc7;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 0 auto 30px;
}
.cards {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(145px, 1fr));
  gap: 15px;
  max-width: 950px;
  margin: auto;
}
.card {
  padding: 25px 14px;
  text-align: center;
  background: #111a2d;
  border: 1px solid #263c60;
  border-radius: 14px;
  transition: .25s;
}
.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-5px);
  border-color: #00eaff;
  box-shadow: 0 0 20px #00eaff22;
}
.emoji { font-size: 42px; }
.card h3 {
  color: #00eaff;
  margin: 14px 0 10px;
}
.card p {
  color: #b6c4df;
  font-size: 13px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
.about {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: auto;
  text-align: center;
  color: #c1cce0;
  line-height: 1.9;
}
.skills {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 22px;
}
.skills span {
  border: 1px solid #263c60;
  background: #111a2d;
  color: #00eaff;
  padding: 10px 14px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: 13px;
}
.contact {
  text-align: center;
  background: radial-gradient(ellipse, #12223e, #070b16 75%);
}
footer {
  background: #10162a;
  color: #9eacc7;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 25px 15px;
  font-size: 12px;
  line-height: 2;
}
.glow { animation: pulse 2s infinite alternate; }
@keyframes pulse {
  from { text-shadow: 0 0 5px #00eaff; }
  to { text-shadow: 0 0 22px #00eaff, 0 0 35px #315bff; }
}
@media (max-width: 420px) {
  nav { gap: 14px; }
  nav a { font-size: 13px; }
  .btn-outline { margin: 12px 0 0; }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<header>
  <div class="logo glow">⚡ FEARLESS</div>
  <p>GAMING • CREATIVITY • SKILL</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#home">Home</a>
  <a href="#games">Games</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<main>
  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="tag">WELCOME TO MY WORLD</div>
    <h1>PLAY <span>FEARLESS</span></h1>
    <p>
      Gaming, creativity and next-level skills.
      Explore my gaming world and discover what
      passion and code can create.
    </p>
    <div>
      <a class="btn" href="#games">EXPLORE GAMES ↓</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#about">ABOUT ME</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="games">
    <h2 class="section-title">🎮 MY GAMING ZONE</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">My favourite worlds, my favourite games.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <div class="emoji">🔥</div>
        <h3>Free Fire</h3>
        <p>Battle strategy, fast moves and clutch moments.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="emoji">⛏️</div>
        <h3>Minecraft</h3>
        <p>Build your world and turn ideas into creations.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="emoji">🏎️</div>
        <h3>Racing</h3>
        <p>Speed, precision and the thrill of racing.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div class="emoji">💻</div>
        <h3>Coding</h3>
        <p>Learning web development one project at a time.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <h2 class="section-title">ABOUT FEARLESS</h2>
    <p class="about">
      I'm a gaming enthusiast and beginner web developer.
      FEARLESS is my creative space where I share my interests
      and practise building websites. My goal is to keep learning,
      improve my skills and create useful digital projects.
    </p>
    <div class="skills">
      <span>HTML</span>
      <span>CSS</span>
      <span>Gaming</span>
      <span>Creativity</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="contact" id="contact">
    <h2 class="section-title">LET'S CONNECT</h2>
    <p class="section-sub">
      Interested in a website project? Get in touch.
    </p>
    <!-- Replace this sample email with your contact email -->
    <a class="btn"
       href="mailto:your-email@example.com?subject=Website%20Project">
       CONTACT ME ✉
    </a>
  </section>
</main>

<footer>
  © 2026 FEARLESS GAMING<br>
  Built with HTML & CSS · Keep Learning, Keep Creating.
</footer>
</body>
</html>
